=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\"> Constitution +6</a></b>: This item gives the wearer improved health, granting a +6 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Constitution.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Tumble_(skill)\" title=\"Tumble (skill)\">Tumble +15</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Tumble_(skill)\" title=\"Tumble (skill)\">Tumble +15</a>:</b> Passive: +15 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Tumble_(skill)\" title=\"Tumble (skill)\">Tumble</a> skill.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Thief_Acrobat\" title=\"Named item sets\">Thief Acrobat</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Thief_Acrobat\" title=\"Named item sets\">Thief Acrobat</a>:</b> +15 to Jump,&#160;?&#160;% chance weapons will unbalance an opponent, causing -2 to AC.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Morah%27s_Belt.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Morah%27s_Belt.png/420px-Morah%27s_Belt.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"511\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Morah%27s_Belt.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>This thin leather belt is braided with scarves of many different colors. It was worn by the famous street performer Morah when she disappeared through a portal to Shavarath.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816222321\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.073 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.135 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3771/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21869/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6130/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 2/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n113.86%  134.093     45 Template:IO\n100.00%  117.769      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  117.769      1 -total\n 96.81%  114.011      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 39.78%   46.852      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 38.48%   45.321      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 36.69%   43.211      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 34.88%   41.080      2 Template:InCategory\n 24.16%   28.452      6 Template:Popup\n 17.42%   20.515      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cac